{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About This Game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Memories is an episodic psychological horror game based on road thriller, slasher, and survival thriller genres. You are currently viewing the prologue episode of the Dark Memories anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/b00f5a0ca930ba7a3ae33c24c6e6be42.poster.avif?t=1765876774\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/b00f5a0ca930ba7a3ae33c24c6e6be42.webm?t=1765876774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Dark Memories: Brenton Lake</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this episode of Dark Memories, you play as Benjamin, who is traveling to his friend Sarah's family house at Brenton Lake. As he enters the rural roads, weather conditions rapidly deteriorate and heavy snowfall begins. Benjamin finds himself alone on desolate roads, unaware of what this night has in store for him. The conditions that leave you vulnerable are filled with unpredictable dangers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/f8587898a75ffbe9d05659d7ea8e1e77.poster.avif?t=1765876774\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/f8587898a75ffbe9d05659d7ea8e1e77.webm?t=1765876774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/f8587898a75ffbe9d05659d7ea8e1e77.mp4?t=1765876774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue and messaging system with NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental interaction</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2825740?t=1765876774","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/5e675dddaf8df1b7cd95a56b18483d403b97edd0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765876774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/fe5256de2a9f62ce7532a5f65461a9486c69f9d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765876774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/fe5256de2a9f62ce7532a5f65461a9486c69f9d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765876774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features objects stained with blood and includes dialogue that contains strong language and profanity, which are integral to the narrative and ambiance of the investigative experience."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About This Game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Memories is an episodic psychological horror game based on road thriller, slasher, and survival thriller genres. You are currently viewing the prologue episode of the Dark Memories anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic